{"id":"00215","root":"uni00215_1","name":{"ja":"甲斐原　菜央","en":"Kaibara Nao"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"甲斐原　菜央","en":"Kaibara Nao"},"element":"Natural","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-07-16","limited":false,"characterId":159,"profile":{"ja":"木遁使いの対魔忍。種を自身の対魔粒子と練り合わせて未知の植物を生み出し、操る。身体能力は対魔忍としてはやや低いが、後方支援や陽動に活躍している。桐生などからは意地悪く「カイワレ」と呼ばれており、そのたびに訂正するも受け入れられていない。名前を呼び間違えられるのを嫌がっているが、さくらなど仲の良い対魔忍達から親しみと愛情をもってカイワレちゃんなどと呼ばれるのは満更でもないらしく、嬉し恥ずかしそうに訂正という名のツッコミを入れている。後輩の対魔忍達からも影でカイワレ先輩と呼ばれている。誕生日は９月１８日（かいわれ大根の日）。趣味で家庭菜園を作っていたが、拡大していくうちに野菜で利益を上げるまでに。そしてそれを資金に畑をさらに大きくしている。食べる野菜の傍ら、自身の忍法に使うための獰猛で危険な植物も栽培している。素直で他人の言ったことをすぐ信用してしまう性格で、早合点からトラブルに発展することも。","en":"Kaibara Nao is a wood-style Taimanin who blends her own anti-demon particles with seeds to create and control unknown plants. Her physical abilities are slightly below average for a Taimanin, but she excels in rear-line support and diversion. Some, like Kiryu, teasingly call her \"Kaiware,\" a nickname she constantly corrects but never gets accepted. While she dislikes having her name mispronounced, close comrades such as Sakura affectionately call her \"Kaiware-chan,\" which she finds both flattering and embarrassing, promptly correcting them with a playful retort. Junior Taimanin also refer to her behind the scenes as \"Kaiware-senpai.\" Her birthday is September 18th, celebrated as \"Radish Day.\" She started a hobby garden that expanded into a profitable vegetable business, using the earnings to enlarge her farm. Alongside edible crops, she cultivates fierce, dangerous plants for her ninja techniques. She is straightforward and tends to trust others' words immediately, sometimes leading to misunderstandings and trouble."},"illustrator":"ほかん","voiceActor":"青井美海","forms":[{"id":"uni00215_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1102,2204],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[134,268],"def":[102,204],"spd":[83,83],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","250007"]},{